# This EG/VCBM template is designed for pdfLaTeX: it uses legacy Type-1 Times
# fonts (ptmr8t) and [pdftex] graphicx. Compiling with xelatex/lualatex causes
# "missing character" errors and only emits a .xdv (no PDF). Force pdflatex so
# latexmk produces a PDF directly and the ORCID logo / fonts render correctly.
$pdf_mode = 1;   # 1 = pdflatex (direct PDF)
